<title>FRANCE: Rouen October flour exports fell to 62,710 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen October flour exports fell to 62,710 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen fell to 62,710 tonnes in October 1996 from 75,000 tonnes in October 1995, port officials said.</p>
<p>Destinations were as follows (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>    West Africa		   31,875</p>
<p>    Algeria			  7,055</p>
<p>    Latvia			   1,750</p>
<p>    Vietnam			 22,030</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
